{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261019/photo/bkn-20261019165335230-1019_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261019165335\"/><p>的士撞向密斗貨車，左邊車頭嚴重受損。</p><p>今日(19日)下午3時20分，一輛的士沿觀塘鴻圖道駛至巧明街對開時，撞向一輛密斗貨車的車尾。現場所見，的士左邊車頭被劏開，其頭冚摺起，車頭燈、擋風玻璃及倒後鏡等均告損毀，並懷疑出現漏油情況，幸好司機並無大礙。另外，現場一支燈柱懷疑亦被波及受損。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T08:59:40.663709+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":149,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T08:53:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T08:57:42.140571+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T08:57:42.140571+00:00","content_hash":"efb04cbb26548b29bd0b39205fbb4c7344b6b6b108ca4c852f02f043d2f171fc","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}